### CBOW

* $\mathbf h = s(A \mathbf x)$
* $\mathbf y = s(A_2 \mathbf h)$
* $\mathbf x \in \mathbb{R}^d$, $A \in \mathbb{R}^{(300, d)}$,
* $\mathbf h \in \mathbb{R}^{300}$, and $A_2 \in \mathbb{R}^{(d, 300)}$
:::

::: {.callout-tip icon="false" .fragment}
### Dense representation

* Columns of $A$
:::
